<title>UK: Bankgesellschaft sets 2.0 bln Lux franc 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Bankgesellschaft sets 2.0 bln Lux franc 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BGB FINANCE (IRELAND) PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  BANKGESELLSCHAFT BERLIN</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    15.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE 14/15.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 4.49 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 50-250    GOV LAW    ENGLISH   PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
